WEBVTT

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.260
One foiled plot after another...

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.140
...and now we are down to our last piece of Zonder Metal.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.010
What do you intend to do about this, my Four Machine Kings?

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.210
Please rest assured, Lord Pasdar.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.990
The strategy Primarda and I devised for our next foray...

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.490
...will soon be ready to set into motion.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.650
The only thing left to do is to proceed without catching the attention...

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.390
...of that Scrap Metal Brigade.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:38.790
Then allow me to play the role of decoy and divert their attention.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.930
No, it's still too soon to engage with them directly.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:53.240
In that case...

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.350
I will be using this.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:15.070
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:21.910
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.070
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:32.790
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.070
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:41.990
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.910
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.710
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:52.470
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:57.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:00.640
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.180
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:06.310
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:09.270
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.350
Dividing Driver!

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:20.990
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:26.870
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.820
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:33.710
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.090
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.420
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:41.140
Beyond the Dimensions

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.810
<i>Beyond the Dimensions</i>

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.060
What! Mic's escaped again?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:53.060
He was scheduled for a checkup on his transformation program today.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.530
Ugh! And as usual, I can't get in touch with my brother.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.280
Awesome, baby!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:17.340
Whoa! I've turned back into CR-Mic again, right?

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:20.760
There's no question about it.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.390
There's a safety program built into Mic's System Change sequence.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.970
But why would that be necessary?

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.210
Toru, your father...

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.790
He's gone off to that world between the sea and the sky.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.010
Father...

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:05.180
If only I could fly away to that world between the sea and the sky...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.140
Yay! Enjoying the ride, boys and girls?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.850
This is way cool!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.150
Waha!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.110
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.150
Take off!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.400
Wow...

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:22.990
If I could ride that...

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.990
...maybe I'd make it to the world between the sea and the sky.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.460
Even an exquisite piece of modeling work like that...

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.500
...is no match for the real thing, eh?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.500
Who's there?

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.100
There is nothing to fear.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.850
We will gladly make your dream come true.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.230
My dream?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.820
Father...

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.420
I'm not afraid!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.920
I'm not afraid! Gangway!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.420
Mic!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.340
Hey everybody, are you having a good time?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.680
Yeah!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:38.230
Fainting at the mere sight of a robot... I'm so envious!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.400
Take that!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.530
What the heck is that?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.360
Huh?

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.610
Is it a hovercraft, maybe?

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.530
No, it's not!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:53.490
50 years ago, the Convair Co. made prototypes of that vehicle.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.870
A seaplane fighter aircraft, the F2Y Sea Dart!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:04.590
Zonder!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.090
Mamoru!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.260
Look out!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.240
Everyone disappeared!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:31.870
Reiko!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.410
Zonder!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.210
We're getting out of here, all right?

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:53.220
They all... they all vanished!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.770
Those who were killed won't be coming back to life.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.680
That's a cold thing to say!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:01.100
And screaming and wailing's gonna bring them back, huh!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.020
It was after me. That Zonder fighter plane...

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.320
The others had nothing to do with it, but they got caught up in this anyway.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.030
I was supposed to be in charge, but I couldn't do anything to help them!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.700
Mic is just a useless robot, right?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.960
It's still coming after us!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.130
Shit!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:36.220
I, Mic Sounders the 13th, will protect everyone if it's the last thing I do!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.490
Oh! Mr. Volfogg!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.410
Mic, I want you to take the children somewhere safe.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.160
I shall hold off the enemy.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.080
Okay, Mister V! We're gonna leave the rest to you!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.670
Holographic Camouflage!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.850
Is it possible that the enemy is using the camouflage technique as well?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.350
GunDober!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.190
GunGlue!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.410
Three Become One!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.380
Big Volfogg!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.180
4,000 Magnum!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.560
Curses!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.810
No!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.070
I-I've discovered his secret.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.280
How he's able to make himself invisible...

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.360
It is done by...

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.490
Oh! I guess he's not coming after us, huh?

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.330
Does this mean we're saved?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.750
What happened to that purple robot who came to rescue us?

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.130
Here it comes again!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.460
Take your hands off me!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.460
Whoa!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.310
Oh, no! He's closing in on us, isn't he?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.060
I'm not afraid!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.520
Mic, can't you use that power of yours?

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.490
Okay! Mic's gonna give it a go, all right?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.110
System Change!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.530
Whoops!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.660
Once more! System Change!

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:12.000
Why isn't it working? Unbelievable!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.010
We're goners!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.350
Help me!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:41.820
Huh?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:46.200
Galeon! So it was you who saved us.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.540
Did the others...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.420
...vanish along with the Baribarien?

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.470
It can't be true.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.840
Hana...

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.260
Ushi...

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.640
Takayasu...

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:05.850
Reiko...

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.890
My friends!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.900
Professor, how is the enemy making himself invisible?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.860
It's a parallel space.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:21.990
Parallel space?

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.240
Another space that exists beyond the one we live in...

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.080
...separated by a dimensional wall.

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.630
Most likely, that Zonder has the ability to go beyond the dimensional wall...

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.670
...and move freely between the two spaces.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.880
Then that means that the people who got "erased"...

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.090
...were actually taken away to another dimension?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:43.140
The possibility that they're still alive is quite high.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.300
We might have a chance at rescuing them!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.480
If we can just pinpoint the exact location of that parallel space!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.650
Mamoru...

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.440
It's my fault.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.820
It's all because of me that everyone...

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.990
That Zonder's to blame. It's not your fault, Mamoru.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.360
If it hadn't been for me, you know...

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.910
It's my fault for not being able to System Change!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:08.740
Curse you, Zonder! I'll make you pay!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.800
GaiGar!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.680
This is Hyuuma. I've found something interesting.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.260
It's the end of Big Volfogg's Jet Wapper.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.680
The rest seems to have vanished in mid-air.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.560
Ah! That means...

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.560
Ushi! Get the Pliers ready!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:35.730
Roger!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:39.690
That means that Big Volfogg is somewhere beyond that dimension.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:40.860
Right.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:44.740
We've found the only key that will open the door to the parallel space!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.260
Damn!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.390
Gai, the Pliers will be there in another 60 seconds.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.180
Be ready to do the Tool Connect!

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.100
Right!

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.730
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.400
Roger! Final Fusion...

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.940
Program Drive!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:26.780
Final Fusion!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:37.710
You're not getting in our way!

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:42.880
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:50.220
I can't do anything about this, can I?
Mic is a useless robot, right?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.140
You guys...

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.890
Hey guys, I've got your back!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.440
Don't cower, show yourself and fight!

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:07.650
GaoGaiGar!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.620
GaoGaiGar!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.330
It's the Pliers!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.340
All right!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.590
Dimension Pliers!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.800
Tool Connect!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.120
What's this?

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.620
This feeling I'm getting?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.250
A voice... I can hear a voice!

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.440
Mamoru?

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.940
Mamoru, what's going on? You were spacing out, weren't you?

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.400
I heard a voice just now.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:30.400
A voice?

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.950
They're alive, see? Hana, Ushi, and Takayasu...

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.830
All my classmates are alive!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:38.000
Oh! Is that really true?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.920
That must be...

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.830
All right!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.130
I've found it! The parallel space!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.050
Here goes!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:53.840
Yee-haw!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:58.930
We just made it, didn't we?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.930
GaoGaiGar!

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.350
Mic! And you, Mamoru!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.770
Why did you follow me in here?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.730
Because I heard a voice!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.190
Everyone's alive in here somewhere, you see!

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.200
Everybody got erased because of me, you know!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.870
So I'm going to join the fight, too!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.280
But, listen...

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:19.790
Zonder! Look out!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:23.870
What?

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.380
Hey, it disappeared again!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:29.630
Professor, if he gets hit by a Zonder missile inside that parallel space...

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.800
...what's going to happen to GaoGaiGar?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.300
I'd have to say...

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:36.720
That would most likely send him into yet another parallel space...

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.470
...from which he'll be unable to escape.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.060
Tool Out!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.030
Help!

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:58.280
Oh, no!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.500
That light just now!

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.460
Oh! Mr. Volfogg!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.840
So you're all right!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:13.550
Yes.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.970
Okay! Mic, take Mamoru and go find those children.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.850
We'll hold off the Zonder!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:19.890
Roger!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.520
You shall not advance one inch beyond this point!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.570
Over there, Mic!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:36.860
The voice I heard when we were outside is coming from over there!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.200
Yes, sir!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.200
Oh! I'm picking up the signal from my Baribarien!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.840
Protect Shade!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.630
4,000 Magnum!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.720
We're not going to get anywhere at this rate!

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.890
You've got to hurry, Mic, Mamoru!

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.730
There it is, Mic! It's the Baribarien!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:09.650
Oh, yeah! I can see everybody there too!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.030
We've found them, right?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.490
Are they alive?

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.950
They're all right! I can hear their heartbeats just fine!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.750
I'm so glad they're okay!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:36.050
But, that voice I heard calling to me... Whose voice was that?

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.390
Broken Magnum!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.320
Mister V!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.110
Mic!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.320
Sorry to keep you big robots waiting!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.740
Everybody's okay, Big Brother Gai!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.030
All right! We're getting out of here, then!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.330
Roger!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:05.910
Fog Gas!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.760
Gai and the others are on their way back now.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.930
Big Volfogg and the Baribarien as well!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:28.100
Captain! Let's take that freaky dimension and blast it away!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.520
You don't have to tell me twice!

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:32.940
Let's do it, Pliers!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.380
All right! Don't let that thing get away!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:58.960
Big Volfogg!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.010
If you please, break down that Zonder Barrier now!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.010
Roger!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.590
Melting Siren!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.680
Double Tonfa!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.770
All right! Goldion Hammer...

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.600
...activation approved!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:16.980
Roger!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:21.820
Goldion Hammer... safety device... relieve!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.370
It's finally my turn to step up to the plate!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.890
Hammer Connect!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:53.390
Goldion Hammer!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.030
Hammer Hell!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.320
Hammer Heaven!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:17.130
Transform into light!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:32.810
Mamoru, now it's your turn, right?

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:34.100
Right!

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:44.860
Huh?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.030
What the?

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.200
Did that Zonder just turn himself back into human form without any help?

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.460
What's going on here?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.710
I have no idea.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:01.840
How was he able to turn back without being Purified by Mamoru?

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.930
Human children may have more power than adults...

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:11.300
...but as we suspected, they are not appropriate Zonder hosts.

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:15.350
Hmph! Our job was to buy time for the others anyway.

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:19.860
Polonaise and Primarda should be finishing up the refueling process.

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.440
Still...

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:34.330
That child...

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:36.410
Who in the world is he?

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.900
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:52.240
The city of Tokyo has now fallen into the Zonderians' hands.

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:54.570
What will become of the 10 million people...

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.660
